kubectl apply -k k8s/overlays/prod/

But don't use the same YAML for Dev, QA and Prod

This is where overlays come in.

base/
   │
   ├── Deployment
   ├── Service
   ├── Ingress
   └── HPA
          │
          ├───────────────┐
          ▼               ▼
        dev             qa              prod

For example:

dev
replicas = 1
CPU = 100m
Memory = 256Mi

qa
replicas = 2
CPU = 250m
Memory = 512Mi

prod
replicas = 3+
CPU = 250m
Memory = 512Mi
